WEBVTT

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.000
Our afternoon team activity 
will be food procurement.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.840
Yay! I hope we can get some meat!

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.910
Emergency provisions had just run out, too.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.470
This won't turn out very well.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.900
Because every single time, 
some idiot goes charging in headlong.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.720
Hey! Who do you mean?!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.170
I mean you, of course!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.850
Huh?! You take that back!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.610
You two need to get along better!

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.050
But...!

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.240
Be friendlier!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:24.240
<b>Friendly Showdown</b>

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.320
Ow!

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:23.050
Come back!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.230
My midnight snack...

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.160
Hey, Asagao, it's your fault!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.750
And don't you owe me an apology?!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.920
You're the one who ran into me!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.920
I spotted it first!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.500
No, you didn't! I did!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.060
Good grief.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.190
Yes, I did! Where were <i>you</i> looking?!

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.760
Can't you get along a little better?

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.920
Not possible with a doofus like her!

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.140
That's my line, you know!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:51.140
If we weren't on the same team, 
I'd never do anything with Asagao!

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:55.050
Huh?! You bother me all the time, too!

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:04.410
Both of you!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.000
Disgraceful.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.960
Uikyou and Kikyou of Team Snake!

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.840
They're quarreling.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.590
That they are.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.430
Quarreling is disgraceful.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:27.820
Great timing! Could you teach 
these girls how to get along?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.000
Come on, Nee-sama! I can't get 
along with someone like her!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.730
Like I said, that's my line!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.430
We've always been close.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.910
So, teaching's easier said than done.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.790
Maybe you have some advice, or something?

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.630
We have no advice...

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.010
but the secret to getting along...

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.340
is right here.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.760
There <i>is</i> such a thing?

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:08.300
But I don't think it would work.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.600
Yeah, they're too unfriendly.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:12.760
So...

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.420
On that note...

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.500
Oh! You two!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:19.320
If you insist on seeing it...

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.160
...try taking it from us.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.200
Sazanka! Asagao!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.910
What are you doing?! 
Come on, after them!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.420
Oh, what does it matter?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.760
Let's look for food instead.

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.300
We already lost some, thanks to Sazanka.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.150
Huh?!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.300
Well, we did.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.170
As team leader, I order you!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:48.390
Both of you work together, 
and steal the scroll from Team Snake.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:52.000
Order all you like, but that's still...

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.230
Upon your success, I'll give Asagao 
my side dishes at dinner tonight!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.400
And for you, Sazanka, 
we'll share a futon tonight!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.780
Don't get in my way.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.450
Back at you.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.980
Okay! Here goes!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.290
Ow...

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.250
What is this?!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.380
And learn about teamwork, while you're at it.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.180
Anyway, let's do this.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.410
Yeah...

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.000
Ow!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.960
Don't people usually lead 
with the outside foot?!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.540
I have no idea, you know!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.370
Chocolate vine.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.890
Looks yummy.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.410
Ahh.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.580
Team Snake duo!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.950
Hand over the scroll!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.320
Why're your legs tied together...

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.220
...when you get along so poorly?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.170
Yeah.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.240
Tsubaki-chan did this.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:17.750
Hah! Because we get along better 
than you two do, naturally.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:24.000
But it's all you can do just to walk around.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.190
Yeah.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.420
We'll play your little game.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.740
Wow...

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.520
Have some...

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.610
...chocolate vine.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:40.920
Chocolate vine!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.080
You stupid—

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.600
Ow...

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.080
What're you doing?!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.340
Well, I...

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.450
They're quarreling again.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.880
Disgraceful.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.920
Here goes, Asagao.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:55.890
One...

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.140
...two!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.670
Keep going!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.070
One, two!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.920
One more time!

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.750
One, two!

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:24.630
At this rate, I'll never 
get extra side dishes!

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.050
I'll be sleeping alone.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.090
Hey, what do we do?

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.800
Huh?!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.180
You're the stronger of us, and I'm lighter.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.070
Leave directions and support to me.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.900
Sazanka!

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:55.510
I'll tell you the plan, so lean in.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.750
They've started cooperating.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.150
That they have.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:02.920
But...

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.430
Got it?

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.450
It's a little late.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.260
That's... Sleep Bell Jutsu!

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.310
Too late to realize that now.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.860
Soon enough, you'll fall asleep.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:33.510
Ow!

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.950
I'll keep pinching, so get to running!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.400
No sleep until we take it!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.370
You, too, Sazanka!

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:00.080
Smoke, against us? 
When we're in perfect step?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.770
Too bad it's pointless.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.560
Uikyou!

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:08.740
I can't get loose!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:11.820
Hold on. I'll undo it.

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.900
I have a good nose, don't I?

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.310
Good plan, too!

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.970
We lost.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:25.870
Yeah.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.880
Yes!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.550
Side dishes!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.070
Sleeping together!

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.870
These two get along well.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:45.510
Yeah.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.850
After all, they're unfriendly...

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:51.030
...but there they are, asleep together.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:52.520
Side dishes...

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.320
Nee-sama...

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.160
They tried hard not to fall asleep.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:57.820
Yeah.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:02.990
But I think it would take more 
than pinching to oppose our Jutsu.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.580
I bet they get along so poorly,

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.500
they were pinching incredibly hard.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.380
Which means, being unfriendly 
is its own kind of strength?

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.360
Could be.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.430
They ended up losing, huh?

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.660
They tried hard at the end, though.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.300
But then, fell asleep.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.840
I see.

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:29.440
Well, we'll be going.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.280
You can see to them.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:33.950
Uikyou, Kikyou.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:40.770
Isn't that scroll with the secret 
of getting along really just blank?

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.660
You figured it out.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.630
Are you mad?

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:48.160
That we tricked you?

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.470
No.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:57.010
You played a trick to teach 
them the value of teaming up.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:58.760
Thank you very much.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:02.840
Sure.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:07.580
It's just, watching a dysfunctional pair...

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:13.560
...proves to us all over 
again how well <i>we</i> get along.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:14.620
Y'know?

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.520
Ready to go, Kikyou?

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.200
Sure, Uikyou.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.920
I wonder if they're just 
hiding their embarrassment.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:37.630
Maybe now, they've grown a little closer?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:47.160
Well, just try replacing it.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:49.560
<b>Tag (The Man Is It)</b>

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.280
Replacing it?

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.640
I mean, look.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:53.310
Aren't men big and slow?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:59.690
<b>Once-in-a-lifetime</b>

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:59.690
<b>encounter</b>

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.980
Can't you win if you just get 
behind them, and let them have it?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.760
Oh, good call!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.400
<i>They're talking about men.</i>

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.890
They're too dumb!

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.210
You said it!

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.080
Um...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.210
Look at this!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.020
My rendition of a man!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:18.670
Hey!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.620
Everyone, outside.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.180
Listen up.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.730
Today's classes are canceled.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.350
Instead, we're going to play tag.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.610
For real? Hooray!

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:41.150
However, anyone who gets 
caught gets no dinner.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.110
Huh?!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.440
Hey! That's cruel, you know!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.990
You girls have been making 
fun of men too much lately.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:52.450
You need a reminder that they're dangerous.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.610
The first thing you do 
when you see a man is run.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:57.920
To train your body to do so,

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.860
the person who's "it" will 
be considered "male."

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.240
Male?

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.830
It's man tag!

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:04.830
Say what?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.980
That's weird.

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.640
But, Sensei.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.850
If we think of whoever's it as male,

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.980
we'll have no choice but 
to fight, if cornered.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.270
What do we do then?

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.870
If your only remaining option is to fight?

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:22.400
That's fine. Then, you may fight.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.000
Heck, that'll be easy.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.110
There you go again.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.410
However.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.080
I'll play the part of the man.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.020
No way...

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:37.750
If you remain uncaught until evening, 
or defeat me, you girls win.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.770
That's totally impossible!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:44.970
I told you, I'm training you 
to be inherently wary of men.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.880
We don't stand a chance.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.880
I'll die if I go without food...

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.080
Oh, dinner...

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.080
"No food" is too harsh!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.350
This isn't fair!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.220
Then I'll toss in a small handicap.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.840
If even just one of you 
can remove my hair tie,

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.730
I'll treat that as a victory for your side.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.560
I'll guarantee dinner for everyone.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.860
Either way, it's impossible!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.490
Who made you so mad, Sensei?!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.490
Stupid upperclassmen!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.570
You can go anywhere in Akane Class territory.

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:12.080
Including inside buildings, of course.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.080
So, we begin when I reach ten.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.960
One.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.910
Two.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:22.920
Three.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:31.460
Is your back okay? 
I'll take your place, if you like.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.100
No, I'm fine.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:38.560
I just hope this gives them 
a sense of fear and caution.

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:42.730
Indeed.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.840
What do we do, Nee-sama?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.280
First, let's come up with a plan.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.440
That's my Nee-sama!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.240
You're reliable, Tsubaki-chan!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.660
Sensei said she would play the male role.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:00.750
Mhm.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.460
Which means...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:07.710
she might be using Transformation 
Jutsu to change into one!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:12.730
Huh? What does that have to do with it?

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:17.890
Nee-sama! We know you're afraid, 
but please try to keep it together.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.730
Hototogisu.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.180
Over here.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.160
Okay.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:47.490
Please, don't notice us!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.840
Mukuge, shh!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.080
Thank goodness.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.790
I thought maybe she saw me come in here.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.360
Kagetsu takes off running like a shot.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.130
Yeah, well...

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:23.850
Huh?

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.460
Sensei's snakes!

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:32.770
A scream...

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.760
Somebody must have gotten caught.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.430
Let's hurry and come up 
with a plan to get away.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.920
There's no getting away from Sensei.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:45.600
Huh?! But earlier, you talked about a plan!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.520
Yes, that's right.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.610
A plan to defeat her.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.370
I seriously don't think 
that'll work, you know!

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.760
Nee-sama, that <i>is</i> a bit much.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:58.860
I just know I won't get dinner!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.920
Meat!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.000
Wait, Asagao! That's so obvious!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:15.590
You fall too easily for food. 
Asagao, no dinner.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.480
I'd, at least, like one bite, you know!

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.650
They got away.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.620
Higuruma, can you squeeze in a little more?

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:31.100
Squeeze over that way more, Hagi.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:34.650
If I squeeze any more, 
I'll suffocate and die.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.740
You'll be fine.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.560
I hope she doesn't find us.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.630
Tachiaoi, no food.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:55.870
Ume, Itadori, Fuki! No food!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.430
Hinagiku, Kibushi! No food!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.350
Housenka, Mokuren! No food!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.060
And, next is...

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.190
Sensei, I'd like to fight you.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.340
Benisumomo, huh?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.840
What are you doing, coming right to me?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.620
Because it's rare I get to go up against you!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.760
Your skills have improved.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.510
Looks like you're training properly.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:53.730
However, you're not there yet.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:00.860
No food. Keep up the good work.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.050
My back...

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.400
Hana-sensei.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.050
Are you all right?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.080
I came to see how your back is doing.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:26.510
Konoha? I'm fine.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.980
Here, grab hold of me.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.690
Have you gotten a little shorter?

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.950
N-No, how could I?

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:40.140
Your eyes seem different, too.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:49.300
Your Transformation Jutsu is good, 
Sazanka, but it needs work.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:52.410
Thanks.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:55.380
Sure. But how is your back?

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.340
No need to worry.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:14.310
<i>Now, I'll just take Sensei's hair tie!</i>

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.410
<i>She's too wary for it to work.</i>

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:24.740
<i>No.</i>

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:29.180
<i>Sazanka sacrificed herself 
as a decoy, for this chance.</i>

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:32.750
<i>Everyone's dinner depends on me!</i>

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:34.750
<i>I <i>must</i> do this!</i>

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:35.960
Konoha.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.800
Y-Yes! What is it?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.510
Do you think I'm too strict with the girls?

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:43.840
No.

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.180
I see.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.430
There's no other choice.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.170
We can't have things go 
back to how they were then.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:56.100
We must keep lying about men being scary.

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:07.920
Huh?

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:47.720
Men... aren't scary?

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:51.810
Tsubaki...

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.060
Transformation Jutsu?

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:58.940
What I was just saying...

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:01.520
Tsubaki! Wait!

00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:11.200
Hana-sensei.

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:13.370
Konoha?

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:16.880
Is it your back? I did tell you so.

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:19.390
You're the real thing?

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:20.120
Huh?

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:22.540
Catch Tsubaki.

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:24.750
I messed up.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:27.770
She ended up hearing about you-know-what!

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:31.180
<i>It's a lie that men are scary...</i>

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:33.220
<i>I heard it straight from her!</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.930
<i>What do I do now?!</i>

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:38.970
T-To be continued!
